#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.rst:2
msgid "randn\\_like"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:1
msgid ""
"Returns a tensor with the same size as ``input`` that is filled with "
"random numbers from a normal distribution with mean 0 and variance 1."
msgstr "平均0、分散1の正規分布に従う乱数で埋められた、``input`` と同じサイズのテンソルを返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:4
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`torch.randn_like`, if the seed is fixed with "
":func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed`, the result must be reproducible on "
"any device.  See :func:`randn` for details."
msgstr ""
":func:`torch.randn_like` と異なり、:func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed` "
"でシードを固定した場合、結果はどのデバイスでも再現可能です。詳細は :func:`randn` を参照してください。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:9
msgid ""
"The input tensor whose shape, dtype, and device determine those of the "
"output tensor."
msgstr "出力テンソルの形状、dtype、デバイスを決定する入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:13
msgid ""
"The desired data type of the returned tensor. Default is the dtype of "
"``input``."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデータ型。デフォルトは ``input`` のdtypeです。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:17
msgid ""
"The desired device of the returned tensor. Default is the device of "
"``input``."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデバイス。デフォルトは ``input`` のデバイスです。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:21
msgid ""
"A tensor with the same shape as ``input`` filled with standard normal "
"random numbers."
msgstr "標準正規乱数で埋められた、``input`` と同じ形状のテンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:26
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:28
msgid ""
">>> import qfeval_functions\n"
">>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n"
"...     x = QF.randn_like(torch.zeros(2, 3, dtype=torch.float64))\n"
">>> x\n"
"tensor([[ 2.0468, -1.0365,  0.7300],\n"
"        [ 0.4158, -0.1923, -0.4909]], dtype=torch.float64)"
msgstr ">>> import qfeval_functions\n>>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n...     x = QF.randn_like(torch.zeros(2, 3, dtype=torch.float64))\n>>> x\ntensor([[ 2.0468, -1.0365,  0.7300],\n        [ 0.4158, -0.1923, -0.4909]], dtype=torch.float64)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:35
msgid ":func:`randn`: Normal random tensor with a specified shape."
msgstr ":func:`randn`: 指定した形状の正規乱数テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn_like.randn_like:36
msgid ":func:`rand_like`: Uniform random tensor with the shape of another tensor."
msgstr ":func:`rand_like`: 別のテンソルと同じ形状の一様乱数テンソル。"

